studio: uart_irq_update() no longer returns a value

Zephyr 4.5 changes the return type of uart_irq_update() to void.  The CDC
ACM class used here returned 0 only when called outside its own IRQ
callback, and serial_cb() is that callback.

Applies to petejohanson/zmk 5565f21.

diff --git a/app/src/studio/uart_rpc_transport.c b/app/src/studio/uart_rpc_transport.c
index 6dcac6d..0e636ad 100644
--- a/app/src/studio/uart_rpc_transport.c
+++ b/app/src/studio/uart_rpc_transport.c
@@ -96,9 +96,7 @@ ZMK_RPC_TRANSPORT(uart, ZMK_TRANSPORT_USB, start_rx, stop_rx, NULL, tx_notify);
  * data to the message queue.
  */
 static void serial_cb(const struct device *dev, void *user_data) {
-    if (!uart_irq_update(uart_dev)) {
-        return;
-    }
+    uart_irq_update(uart_dev);
 
     if (uart_irq_rx_ready(uart_dev)) {
         /* read until FIFO empty */
